  "id": "clementine-meringue-pies",
  "name": "Clementine Meringue Pies",
  "subtitle": "Spiced pastry shells with bright citrus curd and toasted meringue",
  "description": "Individual citrus pies combine a cinnamon-clove crust with a smooth clementine, orange, and lemon filling, finished with a lightly toasted meringue topping.",
  "meal_type": "dessert",
  "yield": {
